OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMyanmar refuses to comply with parts of
OL,4,AICJ genocide ruling
OL,5,
OL,6,FMyanmar denied committing genocide,
OL,7,Fsaying its forces had responded to
OL,8,Fattacks by armed groups. It is the
OL,9,Ffirst state to have been found in
OL,10,Fviolation of the 1948 Genocide
OL,11,FConvention.
OL,13,FMin Aung Hlaing said "the term
OL,14,F'genocide' had seriously affected the
OL,15,Fcountry's reputation", state media
OL,16,Freport.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
